    <p><strong>You didn't start your business to become an HR manager. But here you are.</strong></p>
    <p>CoastHR helps small business owners resolve performance issues — confidently, fairly, and without the guesswork.</p>
    <p><em>The truth is, most performance problems aren't about attitude or effort.</em> They're about something specific that's missing — and until you know what that is, nothing you try will stick.</p>
    <p>That's exactly what we do. CoastHR works with small business owners who are done guessing, using a practical framework that identifies the real reasons your team members aren't performing — and gives you a clear, actionable path to fix each one.</p>
    <p>Because performance problems don't all look the same:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Sometimes someone lacks the skill.</li>
      <li>Sometimes they don't fully understand what's expected.</li>
      <li>Sometimes confidence is holding them back.</li>
      <li>Sometimes the motivation just isn't there.</li>
      <li>And sometimes the problem isn't the person at all — it's the work environment or culture.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Once you know where the gap is, everything changes. You stop having the same conversations. You start having the right ones.</p>
    <p>We work with you to turn around your team members' performance:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>We pinpoint exactly what's causing underperformance in your team.</li>
      <li>We provide practical tools and templates to use straight away — no HR degree required.</li>
      <li>So you respond to the <em>real</em> problem, not just the symptoms.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>By identifying and addressing the real reasons for underperformance, your team will understand what's expected, feel supported, and actually deliver.</p>
    <p style="text-align:center;"><strong>Let's resolve the gap in your team's performance.</strong></p>
